    <main id="main">
        <div class="wrap page">
            <div class="tag">Releases</div>
            <h1>Changelog</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Release notes, breaking changes, and migration guides for all DistLLM versions.</p>

            <div class="release">
                <div class="release-head">
                    <span class="release-ver">v0.4.0</span>
                    <span class="release-date">2026-05-28</span>
                    <span class="release-badge badge-latest">Latest</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Production Readiness</h3>
                <h4>Highlights</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Graceful shutdown with in-flight request draining</li>
                    <li>Structured error responses with error codes and request IDs</li>
                    <li>Kubernetes readiness, liveness, and startup probes</li>
                    <li>Backpressure control with configurable queue depth</li>
                    <li>YAML configuration with environment variable overrides</li>
                    <li>Security hardening: CORS, CSP, SSRF protection, audit logging</li>
                    <li>Health check endpoints: <code>/health</code>, <code>/ready</code>, <code>/live</code></li>
                    <li>Prometheus metrics and Grafana dashboard templates</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="release">
                <div class="release-head">
                    <span class="release-ver">v0.3.0</span>
                    <span class="release-date">2026-05-14</span>
                    <span class="release-badge badge-breaking">Breaking</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Security &amp; Features</h3>
                <h4>Highlights</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>API key authentication with scoped permissions</li>
                    <li>Rate limiting with token bucket algorithm</li>
                    <li>LoRA adapter hot-swapping</li>
                    <li>Prefix caching for repeated prompts</li>
                    <li>Continuous batching for higher throughput</li>
                    <li>CORS and security headers middleware</li>
                </ul>
                <h4>Breaking Changes</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>API now requires authentication by default (pass <code>--no-auth</code> to disable)</li>
                    <li>Config file format changed from TOML to YAML</li>
                    <li>Default port changed from <code>8080</code> to <code>8000</code></li>
                </ul>
                <div class="migration">
                    <h5>Migration Guide</h5>
                    <p>1. Rename <code>config.toml</code> to <code>config.yaml</code> or run <code>distllm config migrate</code><br>
                    2. Update port references: <code>8080</code> → <code>8000</code><br>
                    3. Generate an API key: <code>distllm auth create-key --name default</code><br>
                    4. Pass key in requests: <code>Authorization: Bearer your-key</code></p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="release">
                <div class="release-head">
                    <span class="release-ver">v0.2.0</span>
                    <span class="release-date">2026-04-20</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Multi-Node Support</h3>
                <h4>Highlights</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Multi-node pipeline parallelism across LAN</li>
                    <li>mDNS auto-discovery for worker nodes</li>
                    <li>Automatic layer partitioning based on VRAM</li>
                    <li>gRPC inter-node communication with TLS</li>
                    <li>Worker health monitoring and straggler detection</li>
                    <li>QR code for easy worker joining</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="release">
                <div class="release-head">
                    <span class="release-ver">v0.1.0</span>
                    <span class="release-date">2026-03-15</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Initial Release</h3>
                <h4>Highlights</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Single-node inference with OpenAI-compatible API</li>
                    <li>HuggingFace model loading via <code>AutoModel</code></li>
                    <li>Streaming chat completions</li>
                    <li>FP16 and INT8 quantization support</li>
                    <li>Basic CLI: <code>distllm serve</code>, <code>distllm benchmark</code></li>
                    <li>Docker image for quick deployment</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
