        <!-- Features -->
        <section class="section" id="features">
            <div class="wrap">
                <div class="sec-h fade-up"><div class="tag">Features</div><h2>Production-grade distributed inference</h2><p>Everything you need to run LLMs at scale on your own hardware.</p></div>
                <div class="feat-grid fade-up">
                    <div class="feat-card"><div class="feat-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg></div><h3>Pipeline Parallelism</h3><p>Automatically split any HuggingFace model across N devices.</p></div>
                    <div class="feat-card"><div class="feat-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg></div><h3>OpenAI-Compatible API</h3><p>Drop-in replacement. Works with LangChain, LlamaIndex, CrewAI.</p></div>
                    <div class="feat-card"><div class="feat-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg></div><h3>Speculative Decoding</h3><p>2-3x faster with EAGLE-2, n-gram, and multi-draft strategies.</p></div>
