            <h1>Pricing Comparison</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Detailed cost and feature comparison between DistLLM and major cloud LLM providers.</p>

            <h2>Provider Comparison</h2>
            <div class="table-scroll">
                <table>
                    <thead>
                        <tr><th scope="col">Feature</th><th scope="col" class="highlight-col">DistLLM</th><th scope="col">OpenAI</th><th scope="col">Together AI</th><th scope="col">Fireworks</th><th scope="col">Anyscale</th></tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><th scope="row">70B Price / 1M tokens</th><td class="highlight-col best">$0.00*</td><td class="num">$3.00</td><td class="num">$0.90</td><td class="num">$0.90</td><td class="num">$1.00</td></tr>
                        <tr><th scope="row">70B Input Price / 1M tokens</th><td class="highlight-col best">$0.00*</td><td class="num">$2.50</td><td class="num">$0.90</td><td class="num">$0.90</td><td class="num">$1.00</td></tr>
                        <tr><th scope="row">70B Output Price / 1M tokens</th><td class="highlight-col best">$0.00*</td><td class="num">$10.00</td><td class="num">$0.90</td><td class="num">$0.90</td><td class="num">$1.00</td></tr>
                        <tr><th scope="row">Typical Latency (P50)</th><td class="highlight-col">29ms</td><td>45ms</td><td>38ms</td><td>35ms</td><td>40ms</td></tr>
                        <tr><th scope="row">Typical Latency (P95)</th><td class="highlight-col">44ms</td><td>120ms</td><td>85ms</td><td>78ms</td><td>90ms</td></tr>
                        <tr><th scope="row">Self-Hosted</th><td class="highlight-col yes">&#10004; Free</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td></tr>
                        <tr><th scope="row">Data Privacy</th><td class="highlight-col yes">&#10004; Full control</td><td>API only</td><td>API only</td><td>API only</td><td>API only</td></tr>
                        <tr><th scope="row">Custom Models</th><td class="highlight-col yes">&#10004; Any HF model</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td><td>&#10004; Fine-tune</td><td>&#10004; Fine-tune</td><td>&#10004; Fine-tune</td></tr>
                        <tr><th scope="row">Streaming</th><td class="highlight-col yes">&#10004;</td><td class="yes">&#10004;</td><td class="yes">&#10004;</td><td class="yes">&#10004;</td><td class="yes">&#10004;</td></tr>
                        <tr><th scope="row">OpenAI-Compatible API</th><td class="highlight-col yes">&#10004;</td><td class="yes">&#10004; Native</td><td class="yes">&#10004;</td><td class="yes">&#10004;</td><td class="yes">&#10004;</td></tr>
                        <tr><th scope="row">Multi-Node</th><td class="highlight-col yes">&#10004; Native</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td></tr>
                        <tr><th scope="row">GPU Control</th><td class="highlight-col yes">&#10004; Your hardware</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td></tr>
                        <tr><th scope="row">Rate Limits</th><td class="highlight-col">Unlimited</td><td>Tier-based</td><td>Tier-based</td><td>Tier-based</td><td>Tier-based</td></tr>
                        <tr><th scope="row">Offline / Air-Gapped</th><td class="highlight-col yes">&#10004;</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td><td class="no">&#10008;</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>

            <div class="note">* DistLLM is free open-source software. Cost is your hardware + electricity. Typical electricity cost: $0.0003–$0.003/1K tokens depending on GPU and local rates. Hardware amortization not included.</div>

            <h2>Monthly Cost Estimate</h2>
            <p>For a typical workload of 10M tokens/month with a 70B model:</p>
            <div class="calc-row">
                <div><div class="calc-label">DistLLM (self-hosted)</div><div class="calc-value">~$3</div></div>
                <div><div class="calc-label">OpenAI (GPT-4 class)</div><div class="calc-value" style="color:var(--dim)">$62</div></div>
                <div><div class="calc-label">Together AI</div><div class="calc-value" style="color:var(--dim)">$9</div></div>
                <div><div class="calc-label">Fireworks</div><div class="calc-value" style="color:var(--dim)">$9</div></div>
            </div>

            <div class="note" style="margin-top:24px">Estimates based on public pricing as of June 2026. DistLLM cost assumes electricity at $0.30/kWh with 2× RTX 4090. Cloud provider prices may vary by tier, region, and volume discounts. See the <a href="/#pricing" style="color:var(--green)">pricing calculator</a> for your specific workload.</div>
