            <h1>Showcase</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Projects and applications built with DistLLM by the community.</p>

            <div class="grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-head">
                        <div class="card-icon">&#128274;</div>
                        <div class="card-stars"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><use href="#icon-github"/></svg> 2.4k</div>
                    </div>
                    <h3>LocalGPT</h3>
                    <p>Private document chatbot that runs entirely on your hardware. Uses DistLLM for multi-GPU inference with RAG pipeline over local documents.</p>
                    <div class="card-author">by <a href="https://github.com/PromtEngineer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@PromtEngineer</a></div>
                    <div class="card-tags"><span>rag</span><span>privacy</span><span>documents</span></div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-head">
                        <div class="card-icon">&#128433;</div>
                        <div class="card-stars"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><use href="#icon-github"/></svg> 1.8k</div>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Cursor Fork</h3>
                    <p>AI-powered code editor using DistLLM as the inference backend. Supports multi-file editing, codebase-aware completions, and natural language commands.</p>
                    <div class="card-author">by <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@cursor-fork</a></div>
                    <div class="card-tags"><span>code</span><span>editor</span><span>ide</span></div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-head">
                        <div class="card-icon">&#127979;</div>
                        <div class="card-stars"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><use href="#icon-github"/></svg> 980</div>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Enterprise RAG</h3>
                    <p>Production-grade retrieval-augmented generation for enterprises. Connects DistLLM to Confluence, SharePoint, and Slack with role-based access control.</p>
                    <div class="card-author">by <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@enterprise-ai</a></div>
                    <div class="card-tags"><span>enterprise</span><span>rag</span><span>integrations</span></div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-head">
                        <div class="card-icon">&#129657;</div>
                        <div class="card-stars"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><use href="#icon-github"/></svg> 1.2k</div>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Medical AI</h3>
                    <p>HIPAA-compliant clinical decision support system. Runs on-premise with DistLLM for patient data analysis, medical record summarization, and diagnostic assistance.</p>
                    <div class="card-author">by <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@med-ai-lab</a></div>
                    <div class="card-tags"><span>healthcare</span><span>hipaa</span><span>clinical</span></div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-head">
                        <div class="card-icon">&#128187;</div>
                        <div class="card-stars"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><use href="#icon-github"/></svg> 650</div>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Code Review Bot</h3>
                    <p>GitHub bot that automatically reviews pull requests using DistLLM. Provides inline comments, security suggestions, and test coverage recommendations.</p>
                    <div class="card-author">by <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@devtools-org</a></div>
                    <div class="card-tags"><span>devtools</span><span>ci-cd</span><span>automation</span></div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-head">
                        <div class="card-icon">&#9878;</div>
                        <div class="card-stars"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><use href="#icon-github"/></svg> 420</div>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Legal Assistant</h3>
                    <p>Contract analysis and legal research tool. Processes sensitive legal documents on-premise with DistLLM, ensuring attorney-client privilege is maintained.</p>
                    <div class="card-author">by <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@legal-tech</a></div>
                    <div class="card-tags"><span>legal</span><span>contracts</span><span>privacy</span></div>
