                    <ul class="card-features">
                        <li>On-premise trading model inference</li>
                        <li>Regulatory compliance (SOX, PCI-DSS)</li>
                        <li>Real-time risk analysis</li>
                        <li>Fraud detection pipelines</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-icon">&#127891;</div>
                    <span class="card-badge">Student-Facing</span>
                    <h3>Education</h3>
                    <p>Build AI tutoring systems that run on school hardware. Provide personalized learning assistance while keeping student data safe and costs predictable.</p>
                    <ul class="card-features">
                        <li>Student data privacy by design</li>
                        <li>Runs on existing school hardware</li>
                        <li>Personalized tutoring at scale</li>
                        <li>No per-query cloud costs</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-icon">&#9878;</div>
