                    <ul class="card-features">
                        <li>Privileged document analysis on-premise</li>
                        <li>Contract review and clause extraction</li>
                        <li>Legal research assistance</li>
                        <li>Audit trail for compliance</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-icon">&#128187;</div>
                    <span class="card-badge">Local Assistants</span>
